{"@context":"https://flpgiacomini.github.io/atlas/context/v2.jsonld","id":"atlas:event:mass-market-electricity-and-uncertain-transition-2025-2026","type":"Event","name":"Eletrificação de massa e transição incerta: 2025–2026","aliases":["Um em cada quatro e a geografia que se desloca"],"description":"Elétricos alcançam um quarto do mercado mundial, fabricantes chineses ampliam presença e exportações, e trajetórias regionais divergem sob novas políticas, preços e disputas energéticas.","claims":[{"id":"atlas:claim:global-ev-sales-2025","type":"Claim","subject":"atlas:event:mass-market-electricity-and-uncertain-transition-2025-2026","predicate":"began-on","object":{"type":"date","value":"2025","precision":"year"},"sources":["atlas:source:iea-global-ev-outlook-2026"],"evidence":["atlas:evidence:iea-ev-sales-2025"],"confidence":"high","validity":{"from":"2025","until":"2025","precision":"year"}},{"id":"atlas:claim:global-ev-first-half-2026","type":"Claim","subject":"atlas:event:mass-market-electricity-and-uncertain-transition-2025-2026","predicate":"involved","object":"No primeiro semestre de 2026, elétricos responderam por aproximadamente 24% das vendas globais de automóveis; o resultado anual ainda não estava encerrado na revisão editorial.","sources":["atlas:source:iea-electric-markets-uncertainty-2026"],"evidence":["atlas:evidence:iea-ev-first-half-2026"],"confidence":"high","validity":{"from":"2026-01-01","until":"2026-06-30","precision":"day"}},{"id":"atlas:claim:iea-forecast-2026","type":"Claim","subject":"atlas:event:mass-market-electricity-and-uncertain-transition-2025-2026","predicate":"ended-on","object":{"type":"date","value":"2026-08-24","precision":"day"},"sources":["atlas:source:iea-electric-markets-uncertainty-2026"],"evidence":["atlas:evidence:iea-forecast-2026"],"confidence":"medium","validity":{"from":"2026-08-24","until":"2026-12-31","precision":"day"}}],"sources":[{"id":"atlas:source:iea-global-ev-outlook-2026","type":"Source","title":"Global EV Outlook 2026 — Trends in electric cars","publisher":"International Energy Agency","url":"https://www.iea.org/reports/global-ev-outlook-2026/trends-in-electric-cars","trust":"intergovernmental","verifiedAt":"2026-08-24"},{"id":"atlas:source:iea-electric-markets-uncertainty-2026","type":"Source","title":"Electric Car Markets in a Time of Uncertainty — Executive summary","publisher":"International Energy Agency","url":"https://www.iea.org/reports/electric-car-markets-in-a-time-of-uncertainty/executive-summary","trust":"intergovernmental","verifiedAt":"2026-08-24"}],"evidence":[{"id":"atlas:evidence:iea-ev-sales-2025","type":"Evidence","source":"atlas:source:iea-global-ev-outlook-2026","evidenceType":"intergovernmental-statistics","locator":{"year":"2025"},"notes":"A IEA consolidou mais de 20 milhões de elétricos vendidos, crescimento de 20% e participação de 25% no mercado mundial em 2025."},{"id":"atlas:evidence:iea-ev-first-half-2026","type":"Evidence","source":"atlas:source:iea-electric-markets-uncertainty-2026","evidenceType":"intergovernmental-statistics","locator":{"period":"2026-H1"},"notes":"A IEA registra vendas elétricas 4% maiores no segundo trimestre e participação aproximada de 24% no primeiro semestre de 2026."},{"id":"atlas:evidence:iea-forecast-2026","type":"Evidence","source":"atlas:source:iea-electric-markets-uncertainty-2026","evidenceType":"forecast","locator":{"reviewedAt":"2026-08-24"},"notes":"Projeção, não fato encerrado: a IEA esperava que elétricos alcançassem 29% das vendas mundiais no conjunto de 2026."}],"metadata":{"editorial_level":"editorial","editorial_batch":"V2-2020S-03","region_cluster":"Mundo 2020-2026","reviewed_at":"2026-08-24","temporal_status":"mixed-confirmed-and-forecast","next_review":"2026-09-24"}}
